# Periodic snapshot facts

## A photo of a **state**, every period

- One row per entity per **day / week / month** — changed or not
- Jabra `FACT_INVENTORY_SNAPSHOT`: product × warehouse × **day**

## Materialise the level

```
snapshot_date product warehouse on_hand_qty
01-Feb        Headset Madrid     1,270
02-Feb        Headset Madrid     1,180
```
- "Stock on 1-Feb" = one fast **lookup**, not a re-sum

## Measures are **semi-additive**

- Sum across warehouses ✓ · sum across **dates** ✗
- Across time → **average** or **last value**

## When to use

- Tracking a **level over time** — inventory, balances, headcount
